# The Slug blocks, and in response to its trigger it is returned to hand. Its controller declines to pay {1}{G}, so "each creature
# blocking or blocked by this creature" is read as the Slug last existed on the battlefield (CR 608.2h): the Grizzly Bears it
# blocked still gain first strike, though the Slug is no longer in combat.
